WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.648
Very long ago, there lived a righteous man named Zakariyya. Allah chose him with a holy light.

2
00:00:07.048 --> 00:00:13.600
Grandpa Zakariyya was very old and had no children. In the temple, he tenderly cared for little Maryam.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.328
One winter morning, fresh fruit appeared before Maryam! It was provision from Allah.

4
00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:27.960
Seeing this, Grandpa Zakariyya's heart was moved. That night, he turned toward the holy light and prayed for a good child.

5
00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:33.688
Allah answered his prayer! An angel brought him glad tidings: he would have a son named Yahya.

6
00:00:34.088 --> 00:00:42.128
Grandpa Zakariyya was overjoyed! Allah made him unable to speak for three days, so he shared the good news with smiles and gestures.

7
00:00:42.528 --> 00:00:48.096
Children, remember: Allah hears every prayer. Never lose hope in Allah.
